      "answer": "C",
      "reason_rejected": "Frames the concept as a right to challenge state authority, which is an exercise of personality, not its definition."
    },
    {
      "answer": "D",
      "reason_rejected": "Reduces the term to a contrast between legal and physical persons, which does not reflect the functional international‑law definition."
